<form class="ac-sheet item ac-item-shell" autocomplete="off">
  <header class="ac-hero ac-item-hero">
    <div class="ac-portrait-frame">
      <img src="{{item.img}}" data-edit="img" alt="{{item.name}}">
      <span class="ac-scan-corner tl"></span><span class="ac-scan-corner tr"></span><span class="ac-scan-corner bl"></span><span class="ac-scan-corner br"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-hero-copy">
      <div class="ac-eyebrow">ITEM DATA // {{item.type}}</div>
      <input class="ac-name" name="name" value="{{item.name}}" aria-label="Item name">
      <div class="ac-subline"><span>{{item.type}}</span><span>{{system.category}}</span><span>{{system.rulesRef}}</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main class="ac-item-body">
    {{#if system.catalogId}}
    <div class="ac-core-source-strip"><span>CORE CATALOG</span><strong>{{system.catalogId}}</strong><b>{{system.rulesRef}}</b></div>
    {{/if}}
    <div class="ac-page-title"><div><span class="ac-kicker">EDITABLE RECORD</span><h1>System Fields</h1></div><p>Typed mechanical values are separated from descriptive/reference data so the item remains easy to read during play.</p></div>
    <article class="ac-panel">
      <header class="ac-panel-title"><span>Mechanical Data</span><small>{{item.type}}</small></header>
      <section class="ac-item-fields">
        {{#each fields}}
          <label class="ac-field"><span>{{label}}</span>
          {{#if isCheckbox}}<input type="checkbox" name="{{path}}" {{checked value}}>
          {{else if isTextarea}}<textarea name="{{path}}" rows="4">{{value}}</textarea>
          {{else if isNumber}}<input type="number" name="{{path}}" value="{{value}}">
          {{else}}<input name="{{path}}" value="{{value}}">{{/if}}
          </label>
        {{/each}}
      </section>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-panel" style="margin-top:12px">
      <header class="ac-panel-title"><span>Reference & Description</span><small>CONTEXT</small></header>
      <section class="ac-item-fields">
        <label class="ac-field"><span>Catalog ID</span><input name="system.catalogId" value="{{system.catalogId}}"></label>
        <label class="ac-field"><span>Category</span><input name="system.category" value="{{system.category}}"></label>
        <label class="ac-field"><span>Source Book</span><input name="system.sourceBook" value="{{system.sourceBook}}"></label>
        <label class="ac-field"><span>Source Page</span><input type="number" name="system.sourcePage" value="{{system.sourcePage}}"></label>
        <label class="ac-field"><span>Rules Reference</span><input name="system.rulesRef" value="{{system.rulesRef}}"></label>
        <label class="ac-field"><span>Description</span><textarea name="system.description" rows="10">{{system.description}}</textarea></label>
      </section>
      <p class="muted">Core Library descriptions are concise system records. The supplied 2020 Core Rulebook remains the authority for full licensed rules text.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</form>
